<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Melville started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Melville started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns said Thursday it started coverage of CVS Corp, formerly Melville Corp, with a rating of attractive.</p>
<p>-- The retailer's stock opened off 1/8 at 38-1/8.</p>
<p>-- The company announced last month it was changing its name to reflect its new focus on its drug store business.</p>
<p>--Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
